      en: ["Thermal water discovered in 1962 during drilling", "Official opening of the bath took place in 1965", "Water temperature at the source is 96 degrees Celsius", "Total water surface area exceeds 5,000 square meters", "The complex features more than 20 different pools", "Water composition includes iodine, bromine, and sulfur"],
